        "publishedAt": "2026-05-16T10:21:39Z",
        "notes": "## 版本变更 / Changelog\n\n## ✨ Features\n\n- feat: Added selectable CDP browser support (#7) by @arnoldhao\n  - Resolves #5 简体中文\n  - 扩展 macOS、Windows 与 Linux 的 CDP 浏览器探测，支持 Chrome、Edge、Brave、Chromium、Vivaldi、Opera、Arc 与 Yandex\n  - 在设置常规页新增默认浏览器选择与手动刷新入口，刷新时显示按钮 loading 并复用最新候选列表\n  - 将默认浏览器配置接入连接器登录、站点打开与宠物画廊在线导入流程\n  - 持久化默认浏览器设置并补充 SQLite 迁移、Wails 接口、i18n 与前端类型\n  - 收紧 CDP 启动参数为本机调试地址并补充探测、偏好选择与服务注入测试\n  - English\n  - Expanded macOS, Windows, and Linux CDP browser detection for Chrome, Edge, Brave, Chromium, Vivaldi, Opera, Arc, and Yandex\n  - Added the default browser selector and manual refresh button to General settings, with button loading state and refreshed candidate caching\n  - Wired the default browser setting into connector login, site opening, and pet gallery online import flows\n  - Persi…",
        "releasePage": "https://github.com/arnoldhao/xiadown/releases/tag/v0.2.0",
